{'symbol': 'EXC', 'date': '2023-02-22 09:00:00', 'title': "EXELON NAMED TO FORTUNE'S MOST ADMIRED COMPANIES LIST", 'text': "CHICAGO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--EXELON (NASDAQ: EXC), THE NATION'S LARGEST ENERGY DELIVERY COMPANY, HAS BEEN NAMED TO FORTUNE MAGAZINE'S LIST OF THE WORLD'S MOST ADMIRED COMPANIES FOR THE 15TH CONSECUTIVE YEAR. FORTUNE RANKS COMPANIES ON CRITERIA FROM INVESTMENT VALUE AND QUALITY OF MANAGEMENT AND PRODUCTS TO SOCIAL RESPONSIBILITY AND THE ABILITY TO ATTRACT TALENT."}